      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "此时，重物的速度从$\\vec{v}_0$增大到$\\vec{v}$. 悬挂重物的钢绳的张力$\\vec{F}$做",
        "多少功？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解：**在这种情况下，不能认为重物-地球这个物体系是孤",
        "立系统，因为除了重力$m\\vec{g}$（重物与地球的相互作用力）以外，",
        "重物还受到该系统以外的钢绳的拉力$\\vec{F}$. 重物所受的合力等",
        "于$\\vec{F}+m\\vec{g}$. 因为力$\\vec{F}$和$m\\vec{g}$的方向相反，所以，合力的功",
        "等于",
        "$A=(|\\vec{F}|-m|\\vec{g}|)(h-h_0)$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据动能定理，这个功$A$等于重物动能的变化量：",
        "$(|\\vec{F}|-m|\\vec{g}|)(h-h_0)=\\frac{mv^2}{2}-\\frac{mv_0^2}{2}$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得到",
        "$|\\vec{F}|(h-h_0)=m|\\vec{g}|h-m|\\vec{g}|h_0+\\frac{mv^2}{2}-\\frac{mv_0^2}{2}$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "等式左端是外力的功，而右端是系统总机械能的变化量. 因",
        "此，当物体系不是孤立系统时，它的总机械能的变化等于外力",
        "做的功. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "正如通常发生的那样，如果以恒定的速度（$v=v_0$）举高重",
        "物，则外力的功只等于系统势能的变化量. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
